    "body": "Is there any progress for `getImageData()` to use buffer instead of creating/allocating a new one? This could drastically reduce GC use, especially when combined with SharedArrayBuffer. It would be nice if it supports something like `getImageData(sx, sy, sw, sh, buffer)` (with one more exception to be thrown when no enough space for the frame in a provided buffer). ",
