    "body": "These are very cool ideas!\r\nIndeed, this is what we end up doing in our internal CPU-side APIs for these same perf reasons!\r\nThe lowest-hanging fruit here is adding a getImageData(..., buffer, offset) I think!\r\nThat would give us one-copy downloads from canvas2d.",
