    "updated_at": "2021-11-05T23:50:10Z",
    "body": "There's definitely a desire for cpu-rasterized canvas work with zero-copy. We use something similar internally in Gecko fairly frequently. GPU-accel is mostly needed for screen-sized buffers, but smaller parts are often better suited to CPU.",
